## 3. Owner response shape / DTO

The DTO (`OwnerDto`) is generated from the OpenAPI schema; the derived fields are populated in `OwnerMapper`. There is currently NO nesting — `memberId`, `identityKey`, `householdId` are all TOP-LEVEL, and there is NO `apiVersion`/`schemaVersion`.

### `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`
