### OpenAPI schema — `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml` (Owner response schema, ~lines 2094-2264)
The `Owner` schema is `allOf: [OwnerFields, {object with derived readOnly props}]`. The identity-related derived properties (all currently top-level, all `readOnly`):
```yaml
